{"body":{"text":["**Then the threads** standing open, divergence first among them: when a commit lands in some stores it touches and misses others, the holons it wrote marked diverged, the later commit's version found to answer, and the share not delivered kept while the engine lives, as settled at 12/77. *Open: where the mark is kept, and so whether a read may then ask for a holon only where holding says it lies; the threads Where divergence is marked, Where a holon is kept and Holding links to history.*"]},"id":"1M84FFHN9BNZ008","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
{"body":{"text":["**The command line able to commit,** so the field is written through the engine by hand and the author's tools in `author/` go. *The tools going, settled 2026-11-11.*"]},"id":"1M84FFHN9BNZ009","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
