{"body":{"text":["*The engine, the interface and the stores were merged onto main and the site published (19/25); the expressions as uses, the buffer, the interface and the site on the engine, the stores in strata and components declared in their holons, the steps before these, are built, as each part says. The chassis was broken away at the author's word (20/19), built; the git integration is next (19/19). The order is the session's. Proposed.*"]},"id":"1M84FFHN9BNZ00B","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
